# Normal-mode vectors of the tests/apps fixture calc-water-vib (G16 water),
# mode 2 (O-H stretch), in ball-and-stick and CPK.  The arrows are rebuilt
# after each style change; "cpk" keeps the ball-and-stick camera, "cpk-whole"
# fits the whole molecule.
style Ball And Stick
viewall
nmvect 2
snap calc-water-vectors-base
style CPK
nmvect 2
snap calc-water-vectors-cpk
viewall
snap calc-water-vectors-cpk-whole
